===== Notes =====
Alternative firmwares are also available for the RT-AC57U v1.  [[https://forum.ixbt.com/topic.cgi?id=14:65611|ixbt forum]]

  - AsusSrcMod firmware re-instates functions which Asus chose to remove from the original firmware.  VPN support includes PPTP and OpenVPN (including .ovpn file upload).  Tested openvpn client speeds of 18.5 Mbps via ethernet.  **Update:**The AsusSrcMod is no longer available.


**Jan 2020:** Relayd wireless bridge may not work properly with OpenWrt - symptoms are very poor upstream speeds.  Padavan-Ng offers working Wireless Bridge operating mode.  See bug report [[https://bugs.openwrt.org/index.php?do=details&task_id=2816|FS#2816]]

  - Padavan-Ng/Linaro fork. See post by **Alexey** from March 2021 for latest build (fixes LEDs).

Both files can be found here: [[https://www.dropbox.com/sh/dodrugkcewol4n4/AABV5tohoXqyJz5P8xn_7ndxa?dl=0|Dropbox Link]] 





